(A short program that interleaves rapid, feed and arc moves along one)
(continuous path, plus a dwell. Deliberately free of tool changes and)
(tool-length offsets: the standalone gcode module has no tool table, so)
(T/M6 and G43 cannot be parsed headlessly. Chain breaks are exercised by)
(driving the canon's change_tool/tool_offset directly instead.)
